    "statementMarkdown": "Let $a_{0}, a_{1}, a_{2}, \\ldots$ be an infinite sequence of real numbers satisfying $\\frac{a_{n-1}+a_{n+1}}{2} \\geq a_{n}$ for all positive integers $n$. Show that\n\n$$\n\\frac{a_{0}+a_{n+1}}{2} \\geq \\frac{a_{1}+a_{2}+\\ldots+a_{n}}{n}\n$$\n\nholds for all positive integers $n$.\n",
